[{"name":"mcp__lintcheck__ask_human","description":"Ask the human a question and block until they answer. The prompt is the question they read. This tool can REFUSE your text, and it refuses by returning a message. It never throws. So read the return value and print it. If it starts with REJECTED, the human never saw the question. Rewrite your text and call again.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__lintcheck__ask_human(args: {
  // One line naming the decision.
  headline: string;
  // The question, with the options and their consequences.
  prompt: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```"}]

